Gun modeled for high quality games or renders. With steam and timeless themes, it ends up sympathizing and harmonizing any scenario of any game or render.
Data:

  - This model contains 60151 polygons and 31003 Vertices. SubD Off;

  - Model include 10 merged meshes separated by material;

  - Geometry is polygonal , quad and tris;

  - Native format : LXO (Modo 12);

  - No plugins needed;

  - This project already have clean UVs;

  - This project contains textures used in 'illustrative images';

  - All preview images are rendered with HDRI lighting;

  - Previews rendered with IRay;

  - All maps are 2048 X 2048;

  - Textures are sent by email after purchase;

  - File Formats: Modo LXO (native);

FBX 2018;
Wavefront OBJ;
McNeel Rhino3dm;

The wall lamp contains 4 pbr materials (2 for the structure, 1 for the emissive and 1 for the glass).
Contains a .rar with 4 folders of textures:

  -  5 (2048x2048) textures for the first structure (BaseColor, Metallic, AO, Normal and Roughness);

  -  5 (2048x2048) textures for the second structure (BaseColor, Metallic, AO, Normal and Roughness);

  -  5 (1024x1024) textures for the glass material (BaseColor, Metallic, AO, Normal and Roughness);

  -  1 (128x128) texture for the emissive material (EmissiveColor);

